    "raw_yaml": "# 口径卡（harness 校验卡）：不是框架的性能卡。同一个 HTTP 目标（bench server --http-port 的 POST /echo）分别用 harness 与\n# wrk 打，做闭环发压容量标定：两边各自的吞吐上限与瓶颈侧（CPU 采样判别），见 docs/benchmarking.md「交叉验证」。\n# 由 bench/bin/crossval.sh --mode closed 驱动；改动口径请复制成新 id（-v2），不要原地改。\nprofile: crossval-http-closed-capacity-v1\nquestion: 标定 harness 闭环发压上限与服务端上限（64 连接、1KB）\ntarget:\n  transport: http\n  service: BenchService#echo\n  payload: { kind: bytes, size: 1024 }\n  http: { url: \"http://127.0.0.1:19180/echo\", connections: 64 }\nload:\n  model: closed\n  concurrency: 64\n  duration: 60s\n  warmup: 20s\n  steady_window: [20s, 60s]\n  rounds: 3\n  timeout: 1s\nisolation:\n  client_process: separate_jvm\n  server_process: separate_jvm\n  same_host: true\n  registry: none (direct HTTP URL)\nmeasure:\n  histogram: { significant_digits: 3, max: 10s }\n  report: [throughput, p50, p95, p99, p999, max, errors_by_status]\nassert:\n  errors_max: 0\n"
  },
